      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "**Make the picture first, then film it**\n\n1. **HashBidX Image** makes the opening picture from its prompt (shown below it).\n2. **HashBidX Video** uses that picture as the first frame: its prompt describes the motion and the camera.\n3. Press **Run**.\n\nUse the same box to make storyboard frames or a character sheet. Connect a **Load Image** to **reference_image** to change or restyle an existing picture. Pictures and video are charged per run."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "**Make the picture first, then film it**\n\n1. **HashBidX Image** makes the opening picture from its prompt (shown below it).\n2. **HashBidX Video** uses that picture as the first frame: its prompt describes the motion and the camera.\n3. Press **Run**.\n\nUse the same box to make storyboard frames or a character sheet. Connect a **Load Image** to **reference_image** to change or restyle an existing picture. Pictures and video are charged per run."
      },
